  "_pieces": "`games.piece-<id>`: a 大场面 (setpieces/<id>.js) the story screen plays under its beat (rules/tell.mjs `piece`): `piece` names it, the host page plays it through setpiece.js (`playSetPiece`, auto, cover) and ends like a board. `modules`: more JS whose static imports are walked (setpiece.js loads its piece by a dynamic import). The painting libraries it loads on demand (fx.js) are listed in `files`. `art: \"auto\"`: the piece's paintings are the `'art/…'` strings its module names (the same reading tests/phone-board.test.mjs holds every piece to).",
  "_shared": "`shared` holds every bed of the sound kit (kit/audio/music: td · throw · rope · flight · whack · card, m4a + ogg): a board plays the bed its kit names (sounds.json), and 卷一 uses all six.",
  "storyDirs": [
    "worlds/jiuding/art/people",
    "worlds/jiuding/art/items"
  ],
  "_storyDirs": "`storyDirs`: whole folders for the story screen (step 2: every face a 卷一 card shows, every thing its 储物袋 can hold), in the common pack.",
  "_ai": "`ai`: a board a model plays half of (银月, or the book's people): the app asks its cloud-AI consent before dealing it, so the board's clock never runs under the ask."
